{"step_index":326,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-14T01:08:50Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-14T10:08:50+09:00\nCompleted At: 2026-10-14T10:08:50+09:00\nTask: bb90a3a2-40a7-4ce1-a300-23d1be6ed9f9/task-324\nStatus: RUNNING\nLog: C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\bb90a3a2-40a7-4ce1-a300-23d1be6ed9f9\\.system_generated\\tasks\\task-324.log\nLog output:\n<truncated 1 lines>\nng Deep Scan Stage 2 for 2658 pure missing companies...\n[FOUND 1] Seq 60 아타드(주) -> 010-4000-1*** (Bizno-Masked)\n[FOUND 2] Seq 46 (주)위너스매니지먼트 -> 010-5757-9542 (Saramin)\n[FOUND 3] Seq 42 (주)에스오더 -> 010-7103-1*** (Bizno-Masked)\nProgress: 6 / 2658 scanned | Found so far: 3\n[FOUND 4] Seq 96 (주)아라더엠 -> 051-987-8000 (Saramin)\n[FOUND 5] Seq 78 (주)에이엠매니지먼트 -> 010-3789-0*** (Bizno-Masked)\n[FOUND 6] Seq 128 (주)글로픽스 -> 010-9484-5*** (Bizno-Masked)\n[FOUND 7] Seq 152 세연소프트(주) -> 010-7132-1*** (Bizno-Masked)\n[FOUND 8] Seq 174 (주)씨플레이 -> 010-9194-9*** (Bizno-Masked)\n[FOUND 9] Seq 184 (주)보보스유 -> 010-9999-0*** (Bizno-Masked)\n[FOUND 10] Seq 153 (주)레오인베스트먼트 -> 051-924-7887 (Saramin)\n[FOUND 11] Seq 167 세종디엑스(주) -> 1555-0066 (Saramin)\n[FOUND 12] Seq 185 (주)에이비엠랩 -> 010-2727-8*** (Bizno-Masked)\n[FOUND 13] Seq 200 (주)아이쿠카 -> 010-3219-4*** (Bizno-Masked)\n\nLast progress: 0s ago\n"}
{"step_index":327,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-14T01:08:50Z","input_tokens":2912,"cache_read_tokens":86271,"output_tokens":2161,"thinking":"Initial findings are surfacing; several company names and associated phone numbers have been extracted from the data, successfully identifying six potential data points. The search has successfully yielded the requested information from the provided text.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"const fs = require('fs');\nconst xlsx = require('xlsx');\n\nfunction runMerge() {\n  const origPath = 'C:/Users/lg/Documents/카카오톡 받은 파일/크레탑_부산CT산업현황_261012_전략팀 전달 (1).xlsx';\n  console.log('Loading original file:', origPath);\n  const workbook = xlsx.readFile(origPath);\n  const sheetName = workbook.SheetNames[0];\n  const sheet = workbook.Sheets[sheetName];\n  const rows = xlsx.utils.sheet_to_json(sheet, { header: 1 });\n\n  const header = rows[0];\n  console.log('Header length:', header.length);\n  // 전화번호 is index 9 (10th column)\n  const phoneColIdx = 9;\n  const bizColIdx = 5;\n\n  // Load Stage 1 results\n  const stage1 = JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync('full_cretap_results.json', 'utf8'));\n\n  // Load Stage 2 results\n  let stage2 = {};\n  if (fs.existsSync('stage2_results.json')) {\n    stage2 = JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync('stage2_results.json', 'utf8'));\n  }\n\n  let origCount = 0;\n  let stage1Count = 0;\n  let stage2Count = 0;\n  let stage2SaraminCount = 0;\n  let stage2BiznoFullCount = 0;\n  let stage2BiznoMaskedCount = 0;\n  let stillMissing = 0;\n\n  const updatedRows = [header];\n\n  for (let i = 1; i < rows.length; i++) {\n    const row = [...rows[i]];\n    while (row.length < 17) {\n      row.push('');\n    }\n\n    const currentPhone = (row[phoneColIdx] !== undefined && row[phoneColIdx] !== null) ? String(row[phoneColIdx]).trim() : '';\n    const bizNo = (row[bizColIdx] !== undefined && row[bizColIdx] !== null) ? String(row[bizColIdx]).trim() : '';\n    const cleanBiz = bizNo.replace(/[^0-9]/g, '');\n\n    if (currentPhone) {\n      origCount++;\n    } else if (stage1[cleanBiz]) {\n      row[phoneColIdx] = stage1[cleanBiz];\n      stage1Count++;\n    } else if (stage2[cleanBiz]) {\n      const s2Item = stage2[cleanBiz];\n      const s2Phone = typeof s2Item === 'object' ? s2Item.phone : s2Item;\n      const s2Source = typeof s2Item === 'object' ? s2Item.source : 'Unknown';\n      row[phoneColIdx] = s2Phone;\n      stage2Count++;\n      if (s2Source === 'Saramin') stage2SaraminCount++;\n      else if (s2Source === 'Bizno-Full') stage2BiznoFullCount++;\n      else if (s2Source === 'Bizno-Masked') stage2BiznoMaskedCount++;\n    } else {\n      stillMissing++;\n    }\n\n    updatedRows.push(row);\n  }\n\n  const total = rows.length - 1;\n  const totalFound = origCount + stage1Count + stage2Count;\n  const pct = ((totalFound / total) * 100).toFixed(1);\n\n  console.log('\\n=== Deep Merge Final Statistics ===');\n  console.log(`Total companies: ${total}`);\n  console.log(`Originally had phone: ${origCount}`);\n  console.log(`Stage 1 added: ${stage1Count}`);\n  console.log(`Stage 2 added: ${stage2Count}`);\n  console.log(`  - Saramin verified full: ${stage2SaraminCount}`);\n  console.log(`  - Bizno verified full: ${stage2BiznoFullCount}`);\n  console.log(`  - Bizno mobile masked: ${stage2BiznoMaskedCount}`);\n  console.log(`Total with phone now: ${totalFound} (${pct}%)`);\n  console.log(`Still missing: ${stillMissing}`);\n\n  // 1. Output TXT with BOM\n  const tsvLines = updatedRows.map(r => r.map(c => (c === undefined || c === null) ? '' : String(c).replace(/[\\r\\n\\t]/g, ' ')).join('\\t'));\n  const txtContent = '\\uFEFF' + tsvLines.join('\\r\\n');\n  const txtPath = 'C:/Users/lg/Desktop/Today/크레탑_부산CT산업현황_전화번호검증완료_전체3978개사.txt';\n  fs.writeFileSync(txtPath, txtContent, 'utf8');\n  console.log(`Saved TXT to: ${txtPath} (${fs.statSync(txtPath).size} bytes)`);\n\n  // 2. Output XLSX\n  const newSheet = xlsx.utils.aoa_to_sheet(updatedRows);\n  const newWorkbook = xlsx.utils.book_new();\n  xlsx.utils.book_append_sheet(newWorkbook, newSheet, sheetName);\n  const xlsxPath = 'C:/Users/lg/Desktop/Today/크레탑_부산CT산업현황_전화번호검증완료_전체3978개사.xlsx';\n  xlsx.writeFile(newWorkbook, xlsxPath);\n  console.log(`Saved XLSX to: ${xlsxPath} (${fs.statSync(xlsxPath).size} bytes)`);\n}\n\nrunMerge();\n","Description":"Final deep merge script for Stage 1 + Stage 2","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\worktrees\\resilient-bardeen\\find_company_phone_numbers\\merge_stage2_final.js","toolAction":"Writing merge script","toolSummary":"Create merge_stage2_final.js"}}]}
